        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deep and wide, searching for veins to mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/22a2bdf4b529c8cb3b20dac6f3465a50.poster.avif?t=1755890486\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/22a2bdf4b529c8cb3b20dac6f3465a50.webm?t=1755890486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/22a2bdf4b529c8cb3b20dac6f3465a50.mp4?t=1755890486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DYNAMITE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/ca1f439e82fb12ca24a6fa7ec7c1d95c.poster.avif?t=1755890486\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/ca1f439e82fb12ca24a6fa7ec7c1d95c.webm?t=1755890486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/ca1f439e82fb12ca24a6fa7ec7c1d95c.mp4?t=1755890486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stamina, it drains slowly in the mine and faster when mining. Don't run out of stamina in the mine or you'll never get back up. Sleep to recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/5786a513b3e957110de38b6ce57ea1ec.poster.avif?t=1755890486\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/5786a513b3e957110de38b6ce57ea1ec.webm?t=1755890486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/5786a513b3e957110de38b6ce57ea1ec.mp4?t=1755890486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory, you can't take everything with you at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/5ae541d4ff18ec1a629739de7f859346.poster.avif?t=1755890486\" width=780 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/5ae541d4ff18ec1a629739de7f859346.webm?t=1755890486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/5ae541d4ff18ec1a629739de7f859346.mp4?t=1755890486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your torches, you have a limited number of them and navigating in the darkness is... hard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ore prices reset every day, should you sell now to free up inventory or wait for better prices?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your coins on torches, dynamite, upgrades for inventory, pickaxe power, max stamina, rest stamina etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/7715d6ef323f054f7c038eb2c435c09a.poster.avif?t=1755890486\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924340/extras/7715d6ef323f054f7c038eb2c435c09a.webm?t=1755890486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.